{"a":[15,16],"h":"<p>15.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"59\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 59.0 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 15.2\" y=\"23.5\" class=\"Z19101\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text><text x=\"15.2 23.4 23.4 29.6 35.6 35.6 43.3 49.6\" y=\"24.3 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5\" class=\"Z19091\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> işte o gün - dekkei vahide olduğu, nefhai saniye vuku' bulduğu vakıt<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"107\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 106.8 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0\" y=\"23.5\" class=\"Z19101\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text><text x=\"15.2 15.2 15.2 21.5 27.7 27.7 33.7 40.0 47.4 47.4 54.4 68.8 68.8 83.9 89.9 96.1\" y=\"23.5 23.5 18.7 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5\" class=\"Z19091\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> vakı'a vuku' bulmuş - en büyük musîbet olan Kıyamet kopmuş « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"224\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 224.2 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 3.0 9.2 15.5 15.5 21.5 43.6 43.6 62.8 62.8 68.8 94.2 94.2 94.2 100.4 106.4 113.4 119.6 137.9 144.1 151.6 151.6 157.8 164.0 164.0 170.0 177.7 177.7 208.4 208.4 214.7\" y=\"23.5 23.5 18.7 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 18.7 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5\" class=\"Z19091\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text><text x=\"27.7 49.6 106.4\" y=\"23.5\" class=\"Z19101\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> » sirri zâhir olmuş, Allahın diledikleri müstesna olmak üzere aşağıda ve yukarıda bulunan kimselerin hepsi bir sa'ka ile yıkılıp serilmiştir. 16. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"123\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 123.4 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 89.4\" y=\"23.5\" class=\"Z19101\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text><text x=\"15.5 15.5 21.5 21.5 27.7 35.9 46.9 53.9 68.0 68.0 83.2 83.2 100.4 100.4 106.4 112.7\" y=\"23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5\" class=\"Z19091\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> Sema da çatlamış yarılmıştır. -<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"127\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 127.4 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 57.7\" y=\"23.5\" class=\"Z19101\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text><text x=\"15.2 15.2 15.2 21.5 27.7 27.7 35.9 42.1 57.7 65.9 65.9 72.1 78.4 78.4 85.8 100.2 110.5 110.5 118.0\" y=\"23.5 23.5 18.7 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5\" class=\"Z19091\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> o da bugün porsumuş sarkmıştır - Allahü a'lem « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"323\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 323.0 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 7.8 13.8 20.0 27.0 27.0 33.0 47.4 47.4 53.6 64.7 64.7 70.7 70.7 70.7 76.9 85.1 85.1 92.0 106.4 115.8 115.8 122.8 122.8 129.0 144.6 144.6 150.8 157.1 165.2 171.5 171.5 178.2 184.4 184.4 198.8 198.8 204.8 204.8 211.1 219.2 230.3 237.2 251.4 251.4 261.0 261.0 278.3 292.7 298.7 298.7 306.4 312.4\" y=\"23.5 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 18.7 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5\" class=\"Z19091\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text><text x=\"20.0 115.8 267.2\" y=\"23.5\" class=\"Z19101\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> » sirri zâhir olmuş, şems ve kamer tutulmuş, yıldızlar tolunmuş, Sema henüz dürülmemiş fakat hazîn, mükedder, pusarık bir sîma, gam âlud bir gamam, bir bulut manzarasiyle yarılıp etekleri sarkmış 17. </p>"}